# The motion switches' sweep (`e2e/motion-combos.spec.ts`): eight Lava Axes, one for each combination of
# card motion, screen shake and looping animation, cast at the AI's face in one main phase. Five damage is
# the least a spell's blow shakes the table for (`numbers.ts`'s `boltShakePx`), and the bolt flies to it
# (`[data-projectile]`), so each cast shows whether the board shook and threw. Forty Mountains pay for all
# eight. Serra Angel flies (`card.css`'s endless flight loop) and Slippery Bogle is hexproof (its sweep):
# the loops the Looping animations switch pauses. The AI has 200 life, no hand and nothing to do.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=200
humanhand=Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe;Lava Axe
humanbattlefield=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Serra Angel;Slippery Bogle
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
